---
layout: base
permalink: /projects/
eleventyNavigation:
    key: Projects
---

<div class="container">
    <h1>Projects</h1>

    <p>
        Here's a selection of some of my software side projects &amp; small
        tools. This is mostly a curated compilation of my Github repos.
    </p>

    <div class="project-grid u-mt2">
        {% for project in projects %}
        {% if project.type == 'project' %}
            <div class="card card--project">
                {% if project.github %}
                    {% set repoPath = project.github | replace("https://github.com/", "") %}
                    {% set imageUrl = "https://opengraph.githubassets.com/1/" + repoPath %}
                    <div class="card__image">
                        <img src="{{ imageUrl }}" alt="{{ project.title }}" loading="lazy" width="600" height="300">
                    </div>
                {% elseif project.image %}
                    <div class="card__image">
                        <img src="{{ project.image | url }}" alt="{{ project.title }}" loading="lazy" width="600" height="300">
                    </div>
                {% else %}
                    <div class="card__image card__image--placeholder">
                        <span>{{ project.title }}</span>
                    </div>
                {% endif %}
                <div class="card__content">
                    <h3 class="card__title">{{ project.title }}</h3>
                    <p class="card__description">{{ project.description | safe }}</p>
                    
                    <div class="card__tags">
                        {% for tag in project.tags %}
                            <span class="chip">{{ tag }}</span>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </div>

                    <div class="card__footer">
                        {% if project.github %}
                            <a href="{{ project.github }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link--icon">
                                {% icon "github" %} GitHub
                            </a>
                        {% endif %}
                        
                        {% if project.url and project.url != project.github %}
                             <a href="{{ project.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link--demo">
                                {% icon "link-external" %} Open
                             </a>
                        {% endif %}
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <h2>Tools</h2>

    <p>
        Some of the mostly random small tools I've built at some point or another to
        solve a specific problem.
    </p>

